<title>USA: NorAm Energy Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>NorAm Energy Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.50		    $0.47</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.46		     0.47</p>
<p> Net			 68,600		   60,900</p>
<p> Oper Revs		145,200		  168,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     137,956		  124,991</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     152,183		  124,991</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for the 1996 quarter include a charge of $22.3 million for early retirement, severance and reorganization of certain units and reflect payment of a $2 million preferred dividend requirement. Those prefered shares were exchanged for convertible debt in June 1996.</p>
<p>NorAm Energy Corp.</p>
